# Build context is the repo root (BuildKit reads this file beside the Dockerfile).
# website/public/verified/** and website/src/data/verified.json are generated by
# scripts/fetch-verified.mjs on the CI runner before `docker build` and are
# intentionally copied in -- do not ignore them. Only the runner's installs
# and outputs are left out.
**/node_modules
website/dist
website/.astro
.git
